00:45:00,000 --> 00:45:06,000
Problem Child 2 is a 1991 American black comedy film and
a sequel to the 1990 film Problem Child.

12
00:49:05,454 --> 00:49:11,454
The film stars John Ritter, Michael Oliver, Laraine
Newman, Amy Yasbeck, and Jack Warden.

13
00:53:10,909 --> 00:53:16,909
Oliver reprises his role as Junior, an adopted orphan boy exploits who
deliberately wreaks comedic havoc everywhere he goes.

14
00:57:16,363 --> 00:57:22,363
Ritter also reprises his role as his adopted father, Ben Healy.

15
01:01:21,818 --> 01:01:27,818
Yasbeck, who played Ben's wife, Flo, from the first film, this time appearing as school nurse
Annie Young with a daughter named Trixie (Ivyann Schwan) who is also a problem child.

16
01:05:27,272 --> 01:05:33,272
It was directed by Brian Levant in his feature film directorial debut and
produced by Robert Simonds, who also produced the first film.

17
01:09:32,727 --> 01:09:38,727
In addition, Scott Alexander and Larry Karaszewski return as screenwriters.

18
01:13:38,181 --> 01:13:44,181
It was rated PG-13, unlike its predecessor, which was rated PG.

19
01:17:43,636 --> 01:17:49,636
While failing to match the success of the first film, Problem Child 2 was still a
box office success, doubling its budget in box office receipts.

20
01:21:49,090 --> 01:21:55,090
The film explores themes of dark comedy, spoiled child,
slapstick comedy, problem child, vomiting.

21
01:25:54,545 --> 01:26:00,545
The tone is lighthearted and dark.
